<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telerj 11-mo net 76.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telerj 11-mo net 76.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio de Janeiro state telecom company Telerj issued the following statement on its January-November preliminary results.</p>
<p>		    JAN-NOV 96		  JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>    net oper rvs   1.16 bln			N/A</p>
<p>    net profit	 76.9 million		loss 111.5 million</p>
<p>NOTE: No per share figures were provided. All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415</p>
